 1.0], \"rows\": [0.0, 1.0], \"cells\": [[0, 0, 1, 1], [1, 0, 2, 1]] }], \n            [\"focus_group\", {\"group\": 1}] \n        ] \n    } \n},\n```\n\nThis goes into Sublime's key binding setup. With this, you must first split your view, navigate to the new pane, then press Ctrl+Alt+T. \n\n# Setup CLion\n\nAdd the odin toolchain to project settings. It seems like CLion wants to use platform specific file locations in its config files. That will\n break between platforms, and therefore every developer has to configure the toolchain settings per environment.\nPS C:\\Users\\Thomas\\Projects\\gdbuild> \n\n\n\n                                     Get-Content .\\README.md",
